# LLM backend (all optional; without any LLM FinLens runs fully offline with rule-based components).
#
# Default: free local model through Ollama. Start it with `ollama serve` and pull a model once:
#   ollama pull llama3.2:3b
# FINLENS_LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
# FINLENS_LLM_MODEL=llama3.2:3b
#
# The Anthropic API is not used, even if these are set.
#
# Free hosted API (Groq): the LLM rewrites the verified draft answer; falls back to the draft on any failure.
# Create a free key at https://console.groq.com . NEVER commit a real key: set it in your shell or in
# Render's Environment tab, and keep this file free of secrets.
# FINLENS_LLM_PROVIDER=groq
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# FINLENS_LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
# FINLENS_LLM_MIN_INTERVAL_S=15   # only for long evals, spaces calls to stay under tokens-per-minute limits
#
# Rule-based only, no LLM calls at all:
# FINLENS_LLM_PROVIDER=none
#
# Any setting in finlens/config.py can be overridden, e.g.:
# FINLENS_USE_HYDE=1
# FINLENS_CHUNK_STRATEGY=semantic
# FINLENS_EMBEDDER=st
# FINLENS_RERANKER=ce
